<title>USA: Computer Horizons files Year 2000 patent.</title>
<headline>Computer Horizons files Year 2000 patent.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN LAKES, N.J. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Horizons Corp said on Wednesday it filed for a patent for its Year 2000 software, intended to reduce risk, errors and costs associated with Year 2000 compliance projects.</p>
<p>Computer Horizons is an information technology services firm.</p>
<p>	 ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
